":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"pick","children":[{"type":"text","value":"pick"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pick: (result) => SubagentRouterPick;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"result","children":[{"type":"text","value":"result"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteAnswers"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAgents"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SubagentRouterPick.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SubagentRouterPick"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"questions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"questions"}]},{"type":"code","value":"questions: RouteQuestions<TAgents>;","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tagents","text":"TAgents","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"agents","text":"agents","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"pick","text":"pick","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"result","text":"result","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"questions","text":"questions","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction subagentRoute<TAgents>(agents, options?): object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agents/route.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agents/route.ts#L53)\n\nBuild `decide()` questions for a subagent router.\n\nOne yes/no question per agent, plus an `order` choice.\n`pick` returns `main`, one name, `{ names, order }`, or `{ steps }`.\nNames follow the `agents` array order.\n`{ names, order }` overrides `subagents.order` for that turn.\n`then`: agents that run after the other selected agents. The lead group\nstarts together. The `then` agents then run one after another in list\norder, and each reads the text so far. Used only when the router picks at\nleast one agent from each group. Otherwise `pick` returns `{ names, order }`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAgents\n\n`TAgents` *extends* readonly [`DefinedAgent`](../interfaces/DefinedAgent.md)\\<`string`, readonly `SubagentTool`[], [`SchemaInput`](../type-aliases/SchemaInput.md) \\| `undefined`, readonly [`InterruptDefinition`](../interfaces/InterruptDefinition.md)\\<`any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `any`\\>[], `any`\\>[]\n\n## Parameters\n\n### agents\n\n`TAgents`\n\n### options?\n\n[`SubagentRouteOptions`](../interfaces/SubagentRouteOptions.md)\\<`TAgents`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`object`\n\n### pick\n\n```ts\npick: (result) => SubagentRouterPick;\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### result\n\n`RouteAnswers`\\<`TAgents`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`SubagentRouterPick`](../type-aliases/SubagentRouterPick.md)\n\n### questions\n\n```ts\nquestions: RouteQuestions<TAgents>;\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: subagentRoute\ntitle: subagentRoute\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction subagentRoute<TAgents>(agents, options?): object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agents/route.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agents/route.ts#L53)\n\nBuild `decide()` questions for a subagent router.\n\nOne yes/no question per agent, plus an `order` choice.\n`pick` returns `main`, one name, `{ names, order }`, or `{ steps }`.\nNames follow the `agents` array order.\n`{ names, order }` overrides `subagents.order` for that turn.\n`then`: agents that run after the other selected agents. The lead group\nstarts together. The `then` agents then run one after another in list\norder, and each reads the text so far. Used only when the router picks at\nleast one agent from each group. Otherwise `pick` returns `{ names, order }`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAgents\n\n`TAgents` *extends* readonly [`DefinedAgent`](../interfaces/DefinedAgent.md)\\<`string`, readonly `SubagentTool`[], [`SchemaInput`](../type-aliases/SchemaInput.md) \\| `undefined`, readonly [`InterruptDefinition`](../interfaces/InterruptDefinition.md)\\<`any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `any`\\>[], `any`\\>[]\n\n## Parameters\n\n### agents\n\n`TAgents`\n\n### options?\n\n[`SubagentRouteOptions`](../interfaces/SubagentRouteOptions.md)\\<`TAgents`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`object`\n\n### pick\n\n```ts\npick: (result) => SubagentRouterPick;\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### result\n\n`RouteAnswers`\\<`TAgents`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`SubagentRouterPick`](../type-aliases/SubagentRouterPick.md)\n\n### questions\n\n```ts\nquestions: RouteQuestions<TAgents>;\n```\n"}
